nal modem; this fix was requested and its preconditions were met. No hardware replacement is needed since the modem has already re-registered and reports OPERATIONAL. If such outages recur, raise the upstream sync/TFTP registration fault with the ISP and consider switching the watchdog from observe mode to an enforcing reload action."}}
